    "description": "# RF-5: Restriction Detail Fields\n\n_Fields shown when a Referrer is Paused or Banned — scope still unresolved against Player's simplification._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Restriction Reason — locked\n* Payouts Blocked — locked; all unpaid payouts on Hold\n* Restriction Notes — editable\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Scope not confirmed — hold before building\n\n* Not confirmed in the transcript. Player's equivalent Restriction Detail fields were cut in favor of a banner-only indicator, but that decision was never revisited for Referrer. Raise directly with Kobi/Joyce before building — don't assume either outcome.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-5 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n* Open question carried from the doc: should Referrer follow Player's simplification, stay as designed, or land in between? No precedent either way.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-5 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
